<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>COT 주간 분석</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; background: #f5f5f0; color: #0b0b0b; padding: 16px; }
.wrap { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem 0; }
h1 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.sub { font-size: 12px; color: #52514e; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.6; }
.section-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #52514e; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem; }
.panel { background: #ffffff; border: 0.5px solid #e0dfd8; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.latest { display: block; text-decoration: none; color: #0b0b0b; border-left: 3px solid #2a78d6; }
.latest .t { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.latest .m { font-size: 12px; color: #52514e; line-height: 1.6; }
.table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; }
th { font-weight: 500; color: #52514e; padding: 6px; border-bottom: 0.5px solid #e0dfd8; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap; }
td { padding: 6px; border-bottom: 0.5px solid #e0dfd8; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap; }
td.l, th.l { text-align: left; }
td.memo { white-space: normal; text-align: left; color: #52514e; font-size: 11px; min-width: 220px; }
td a { color: #185FA5; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
.sc { display: inline-block; min-width: 30px; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 500; }
.legend { font-size: 11px; color: #888780; margin-top: 8px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>CFTC COT 주간 분석</h1>
  <div class="sub">글로벌 매크로 CIO 시각의 스마트머니 포지션 분석 · 매주 토요일 자동 업데이트 (CFTC 금요일 발표 직후)</div>

  {% if latest %}
  <a class="panel latest" href="{{ latest.link }}">
    <div class="t">최신 리포트 — {{ latest.week }} ({{ latest.date }} 기준) →</div>
    <div class="m">{{ latest.opinion }}<br>{{ latest.memo }}</div>
  </a>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="section-title">주차별 종합 점수 기록</div>
  <div class="panel table-scroll">
    <table>
      <tr><th class="l">주차 (기준일)</th>{% for k in keys %}<th>{{ k }}</th>{% endfor %}<th class="l">투자의견 / 핵심메모</th></tr>
      {% for r in rows %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l"><a href="{{ r.link }}">{{ r.week }}</a><br><span style="font-size:10px;color:#888780;">{{ r.date }}</span></td>
        {% for k in keys %}{% set s = r.scores.get(k) %}
        <td>{% if s is not none %}<span class="sc" style="background:{{ s|scorebg }};color:{{ s|scorefg }};">{{ s }}</span>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
        {% endfor %}
        <td class="memo">{{ r.opinion }}{% if r.memo %}<br>{{ r.memo }}{% endif %}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    <div class="legend">초록 = 60점 이상(강세 우위) · 주황 = 40~59(중립) · 빨강 = 40 미만(약세 우위)</div>
  </div>

  <div class="sub">데이터: CFTC Commitments of Traders (Futures Only). 누적 수치: <a href="data/history.csv" style="color:#185FA5;">history.csv</a> · 본 자료는 투자 참고용이며 투자 권유가 아닙니다.</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
